  m_text: "ABOUT\n\nGame design, story, sound design, and development: Mil_leR.\n\n\nMUSIC\n\n\u201CEmpty
    Places\u201D by newlocknew (Freesound), licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0.\nEdited
    for use in the game: the ending section was trimmed.\nSource: https://freesound.org/people/newlocknew/sounds/865220/\nLicense:
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/\n\n\n\u201CDream Pool (Ambient
    Dreamcore)\u201D by JackJack (Pixabay).\nUsed in the transition from the Prelude
    to ChildhoodSpace.\nSource: https://pixabay.com/music/ambient-dream-pool-ambient-dreamcore-486226/\n\n\n\u201CDrowsy
    (Liminal Dreamcore)\u201D by JackJack (Pixabay).\nUsed in the transition from
    ChildhoodSpace to Sunset.\nSource: https://pixabay.com/music/ambient-drowsy-liminal-dreamcore-512448/\n\n\nOriginal
    ambient music for the main menu, the Playground in ChildhoodSpace (the location
    1), and Echo of Violent (the location 3): Crework.\n\n\nART\n\nMain character
    sprites: Serinio.\n\n\nGrass tiles from \u201CGrass+\u201D by SciGho, licensed
    under CC BY 4.0.\nSource: https://ninjikin.itch.io/grass\nLicense: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
